# Cloudflare zone IDs for check_cloudflare_status.sh
#
# Deploy to: /srv/nagios-agent.crunchtools.com/config/cloudflare-zones.conf
# Mounted read-only at /etc/nagios/cloudflare-zones.conf in the agent.
#
# The real file is NOT in this repo. Zone IDs identify an account's zones, and
# this repo is public — see constitution XVII. The API token is a separate file
# (cloudflare.token) and is likewise host-side only.
#
# <domain> <zone-id>
example.com            00000000000000000000000000000000
example.org            00000000000000000000000000000000
